# Free EIA Open Data API key for the live "current ERCOT grid" panel.
# Get one in seconds at https://www.eia.gov/opendata/register.php
# Copy this file to `.env` for local dev. For deployment, set the same value as a
# GitHub Actions repository secret named VITE_EIA_API_KEY (see .github/workflows/deploy.yml).
# Note: this key is embedded in the client bundle and is visible in page source.
# EIA keys are free and read-only, so this is acceptable for a public demo.
VITE_EIA_API_KEY=your_eia_api_key_here
